Package: netpredict
Title: Network Congestion Forecasting Lab
Version: 2.0.0
Author: NetPredict contributors
Maintainer: NetPredict contributors
Description: An R application for network telemetry replay, temporal feature
    engineering, calibrated multi-horizon forecasts and intervention simulation.
